                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 150,
                      "heading": "ECON 501: Mathematical Methods for Economists"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 4\nDescription:\nAdvanced mathematical techniques for economic modeling: calculus, optimization, and linear algebra tailored to economic applications.\nPrerequisites: Undergraduate-level mathematics"
