                "title": "ECON 520: Advanced Macroeconomic Theory",
                "level": 3,
                "location": {
                  "line": 165,
                  "heading": "Graduate Courses"
                },
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 166,
                      "heading": "ECON 520: Advanced Macroeconomic Theory"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 4\nDescription:\nExplores advanced models of economic growth, expectations, and policy analysis. Topics include real business cycle theory and dynamic stochastic general equilibrium.\nPrerequisites: ECON 202 or equivalent"
                  }
                ],
                "sections": []
              },
              {
