                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 174,
                      "heading": "ECON 530: Econometric Theory and Methods"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 4\nDescription:\nAdvanced methods in estimation, hypothesis testing, time series analysis, and panel data models. Implementation using econometric software.\nPrerequisites: ECON 221, undergraduate-level statistics"
