                  "heading": "Graduate Courses"
                },
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 190,
                      "heading": "ECON 570: Applied Policy Analysis"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 3\nDescription:\nMethodologies for evaluating the economic impact of public policies in areas such as health, education, and taxation. Emphasis on cost-benefit analysis and real-world case studies.\nPrerequisites: ECON 510, ECON 530"
