                      "heading": "ECON 590: Research Seminar"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 3\nDescription:\nWeekly seminar addressing current research topics in economics. Presentations by faculty, visiting scholars, and students.\nPrerequisites: Enrollment in M.Sc. program"
